     "q": "What are ROLLUP, CUBE and GROUPING SETS?",
     "a": "Extensions that compute several levels of grouping in one query. `ROLLUP(a, b)` adds subtotals per `a` and a grand total; `CUBE(a, b)` adds every combination; `GROUPING SETS` lists exactly which groupings you want.",
