     "q": "How do you generate a series of numbers or dates?",
     "a": "Use a recursive CTE counting up, or built-ins like `generate_series()` (PostgreSQL, SQLite with the series extension) and `GENERATOR` (Snowflake).",
     "e": "Joining a date series to your data reveals missing days, since days with no orders still appear with 0.",
