     "q": "Subquery, CTE, temp table or view: when do you use which?",
     "a": "Subquery or CTE: for one query, to keep logic readable. Temp table: when an intermediate result is reused many times or is big enough to benefit from indexes. View: to reuse a query across many queries and users. Materialised view: to store precomputed results of expensive queries.",
