     "q": "How do you find the second-highest salary?",
     "a": "`DENSE_RANK()` in a subquery and pick rank 2. That handles ties and generalises to the Nth highest. Alternatives: `MAX(salary) WHERE salary < (SELECT MAX(salary))`, or `DISTINCT ... ORDER BY DESC LIMIT 1 OFFSET 1`.",
     "e": "State how you handle ties, because interviewers want to hear it.",
