     "q": "How do you find duplicate values?",
     "a": "`GROUP BY` the column(s) and `HAVING COUNT(*) > 1`. To see the full duplicate rows, join back or use `COUNT(*) OVER (PARTITION BY ...)`.",
     "e": "Then fix the root cause with a UNIQUE constraint.",
