     "q": "How do you find customers who ordered in at least N different months?",
     "a": "Filter orders to the period, count `DISTINCT` months per customer, and keep customers with `HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT month) >= N`.",
     "e": "Set N to the total number of months and it becomes relational division: \"customers who ordered in *every* month\".",
