     "q": "Scenario: a report query on a huge orders table takes minutes. What do you check?",
     "a": "1) The query plan: full scans, bad join order, row estimates. 2) Filters: SARGable and indexed (or clustering/partition columns in a warehouse). 3) Select only needed columns, and aggregate before joining. 4) Missing or outdated statistics. 5) Locks or concurrent load. 6) For recurring reports, a summary table or materialised view.",
