     "q": "How do you get the cumulative percentage of revenue by customer (Pareto)?",
     "a": "Aggregate revenue per customer, order descending, and compute a running `SUM` divided by the grand total `SUM() OVER ()`.",
     "e": "This shows how few customers make up most of the revenue (the 80/20 rule).",
